[Options]

[A.]
<h2>The Know-How</h2>
<i>~y"Pick me up at my place, we can go see a buddy of mine, he's got some good stuff."~w<br>
--~B~E~mMy Hookup~.~w</i>
<p>A guy you know, knows another guy thats in the foreign weapons exchange. But, the people he's currently working for dont take too kindly to people knowing what they know. You must sneak/break past his employers, pick him up and bring him to your island safely to go see his contact. Or you can just kill his employers, either way you need this technology badly.

$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Play Mission,DoNothing,0

[Succeeded][BadTeamDead]
<h2>Atta Boy !!!</h2>
<p>Enrico takes you to his dealers island, and after the deal goes down, he comes back to you with new knowledge of ariel attackers...and some of your money back to boot. Woohoo !!!
<$Config,Done{mission.fileName}=1>
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,four

